            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima kandi Omubuurizi, ahabw'okuba omunyabwengye, yaagumizamu kwegyesa abantu okumanya; yaateekateeka enfumu nyingi, yaazeetegyereza, yaazitebeekanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Omubuurizi yaasherura ebigambo ebirikushemeza, yaahandiika ebigambo by'amazima n'omutima gugororokire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 22:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebigambo by'abanyabwengye ni nk'emihunda, kandi ebigambo by'Omuriisa omwe ebiteerainwe hamwe ni nk'emisumaari ehamire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mwana wangye, oyerinde ekintu kyona ekitari ebyo. Okuhandiika ebitabo bingi tikugira bugarukiro, n'okwega munonga kurusya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
